   Fu, Qiaomei and Harney, Eadaoin and Lipson, Mark and Mallick, Swapan and
   Novak, Mario and Rohland, Nadin and Stewardson, Kristin and Abdullah,
   Syafiq and Cox, Murray P. and Friedlaender, Francoise R. and
   Friedlaender, Jonathan S. and Kivisild, Toomas and Koki, George and
   Kusuma, Pradiptajati and Merriwether, D. Andrew and Ricaut, Francois-X.
